{% comment %}
  Theme hook, called from al_folio_core's bib.liquid after `entrytype` is
  assembled and before the periodical line is composed.

  `additional_info` is passed through `markdownify`, which leaves a trailing
  newline behind after the surrounding <p> tags are removed. The template then
  appends ", " for the date, so the venue line renders as
  "arXiv:2608.00930 [quant-ph] , Aug 2026". Stripping puts the comma back
  against the venue.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign entrytype = entrytype | strip %}
